Civ5 Mod DLC Packer was developed during an investigation of native macOS
support for MPPatch by Lymia Kanokawa:

https://github.com/Lymia/MPPatch

MPPatch and this packer use different architectures. MPPatch provided useful
reference material for Civilization V DLC package structure and UI skin
behavior. MPPatch is distributed under the MIT License.

Standalone builds include certifi's Mozilla root certificate bundle for HTTPS
verification. certifi is distributed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0;
its license is included as LICENSE-certifi.txt in each native bundle.

https://github.com/certifi/python-certifi

